          "@type": "Question",
          "name": "Does an audit trail establish a security certification?",
          "acceptedAnswer": {
            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "No. An audit interface does not establish a certification, regulatory compliance or complete control coverage. ConvergeFlow’s observed audit fields provide a starting point for questions about activity visibility. Request the evidence your organization needs and have the responsible reviewers assess it before connecting systems or making an implementation decision."
